WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:16,920
Leaving a fire hole at this time is leaving yourself with future troubles.

2
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:34,040
I'm injured, I'll come again if I don't live

3
00:00:34,040 --> 00:00:36,300
This world is really in complete chaos

4
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:37,500
It's also expected

5
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:40,860
They have guns. Don't go there.

6
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:42,460
Where did the two women get real guns?

7
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:43,460
It must be fake

8
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:49,180
What I'm holding is a gun

9
00:00:49,180 --> 00:00:50,780
Anyone who is not afraid of death should give it a try

10
00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:52,180
If you don't want to die, get out

11
00:00:52,180 --> 00:00:54,740
This woman can't be offended

12
00:00:54,740 --> 00:00:56,140
run run quickly
